    # Project: Jellyfin KDE Lock Screen Slideshow (Option 1)
    
    ## Goal
    A system that automatically populates a local folder with Jellyfin backdrop images based on how much time the user spends with the screen locked.
    
    ## Technical Stack
    - **Language**: Bash
